{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strap in, pilot. The skies are yours to command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif1.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into your state-of-the-art fighter jet and brace yourself for intense 2D dogfights over sprawling fields, bustling cities, and treacherous seas. From intercepting warheads on the fly to smashing through huge air fortresses, every operation demands razor-sharp reflexes and shooting precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif2.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue squadron known as the Clever Foxes Clan has launched a coordinated, full-scale assault. They've crushed recon units, breached coastal defenses, and now threaten total domination. With communications severed and ground forces scattered, your elite squadron is all that stands between them and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif3.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar into battle, dodge relentless enemy fire, and complete critical objectives across dynamic battlefields. From strafing hardened ground targets to outmaneuvering deadly submarines and aircraft carriers, your skills will be tested at every turn. Victory is earned in the skies\u2014one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif4.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be an ace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D aerial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 challenging missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemy unit types across land, sea, and air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes for all skill levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778060?t=1758562993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/d6227ba914aaba1c041e5dc901dfe624f69b29c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758562993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/58147de52de0aa2c854120bc2930150c33f5bda5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758562993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/58147de52de0aa2c854120bc2930150c33f5bda5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758562993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strap in, pilot. The skies are yours to command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif1.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into your state-of-the-art fighter jet and brace yourself for intense 2D dogfights over sprawling fields, bustling cities, and treacherous seas. From intercepting warheads on the fly to smashing through huge air fortresses, every operation demands razor-sharp reflexes and shooting precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif2.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue squadron known as the Clever Foxes Clan has launched a coordinated, full-scale assault. They've crushed recon units, breached coastal defenses, and now threaten total domination. With communications severed and ground forces scattered, your elite squadron is all that stands between them and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif3.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar into battle, dodge relentless enemy fire, and complete critical objectives across dynamic battlefields. From strafing hardened ground targets to outmaneuvering deadly submarines and aircraft carriers, your skills will be tested at every turn. Victory is earned in the skies\u2014one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778060/extras/gif4.gif?t=1758562993\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be an ace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D aerial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 challenging missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemy unit types across land, sea, and air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes for all skill levels</p></li></ul>","developers":["9Ratones"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.s